diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 4469b86..6ac4daa 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -60,3 +60,27 @@ Marks all unread notifications as read.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `PUT /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Updates the current user's notification settings.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `bundle_email_frequency` | string | Yes | How often to email bundled notifications: `never`, `every_few_hours`, `daily`, or `weekly` |
+
+Rather than an email per notification, new notifications are collected into a window that opens when the first one arrives and lasts the chosen period (four hours, a day, or a week), then sent as a single email.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "user_settings": {
+    "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success, or `422 Unprocessable Entity` for an unknown frequency.
